WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:18.875
Toad hurried down the road.

2
00:00:18.876 --> 00:00:22.802
"The sun is shining!" he said.

3
00:00:22.803 --> 00:00:26.412
"I'm happy and carefree!"

4
00:00:26.413 --> 00:00:30.142
Toad danced a little dance.

5
00:00:30.143 --> 00:00:34.016
"Poor Ratty," Toad laughed.

6
00:00:34.017 --> 00:00:38.222
"Badger will be so mad at him!

7
00:00:38.223 --> 00:00:40.454
Rat's a good friend.

8
00:00:40.455 --> 00:00:45.211
But he isn't as clever as Toad!"

9
00:00:45.212 --> 00:00:49.207
Badger and Mole came back to Toad Hall.

10
00:00:49.208 --> 00:00:52.255
Rat was very upset.

11
00:00:52.256 --> 00:00:55.933
"Rat, what's wrong?" asked Mole.

12
00:00:55.934 --> 00:00:59.272
"Toad's gone!" cried Rat.

13
00:00:59.273 --> 00:01:02.024
"I'm so stupid!"

14
00:01:02.025 --> 00:01:05.940
"Toad said he needed a doctor," said Rat.

15
00:01:05.941 --> 00:01:08.610
"He said he was dying."

16
00:01:08.611 --> 00:01:12.143
"Oh Rat," said Badger.

17
00:01:12.144 --> 00:01:15.335
"You fell for that old trick?"

18
00:01:15.336 --> 00:01:19.738
Inside they found the bedroom empty.

19
00:01:19.739 --> 00:01:22.795
"Never mind," said Badger.

20
00:01:22.796 --> 00:01:25.339
"We'll see him again.

21
00:01:25.340 --> 00:01:29.008
I just hope it's not in the hospital."

22
00:01:29.009 --> 00:01:33.008
"Or in jail," said Mole.

23
00:01:33.009 --> 00:01:38.011
Down the road, Toad was eating at The Red Lion.

24
00:01:38.012 --> 00:01:43.201
"What a yummy lunch!" said Toad to himself.

25
00:01:43.202 --> 00:01:47.934
Then Toad heard his favorite sound.

26
00:01:47.935 --> 00:01:53.201
Vroom! A big car drove up.

27
00:01:53.202 --> 00:01:56.807
The driver and his friends got out.

28
00:01:56.808 --> 00:02:00.600
Toad watched them come into the restaurant.

29
00:02:00.601 --> 00:02:05.810
"They left the car alone," Toad thought happily.

30
00:02:05.811 --> 00:02:09.814
"No one will mind if I look at it."

31
00:02:09.815 --> 00:02:13.284
He walked out to the car.

32
00:02:13.285 --> 00:02:19.471
"Oh my! It's so beautiful," he gasped.

33
00:02:19.472 --> 00:02:22.412
He looked around carefully.

34
00:02:22.413 --> 00:02:26.746
No one was watching.
